nge and long-forgotten secrets. Setting out from his destination of Touryst Island, the traveler hops between neighboring islands dotted with beaches, shops, and quirky inhabitants going about their own business. Rather than lounging by the sea, he devotes himself to investigating the mysterious structures scattered across the archipelago, exploring their depths and solving the puzzles that guard their hidden mechanisms. As he presses deeper into each monument and gains new abilities to reach once-inaccessible places, the tourist gradually pieces together the enigma binding the islands together, turning a relaxing getaway into a quiet adventure of discovery.", "summary": "Discover exotic islands, explore ancient monuments, uncover secret passageways, and make the trip you always wanted in The Touryst\n\nYou are just arriving at the Monument Islands. Want to go swimming? Or rather take a dive into the deep sea? Or do you want to visit the amusement arcade, do some shopping, dance at the beach party? Fancy some surfing? Or will you talk with the strange old tourist and listen what he has to say about these ancient mysterious monuments..", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-touryst", "videos": [{"id": 39129, "name": "Announcement Trailer - Nintendo Switch", "video_id": "Ir2MnrPvO8Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ir2MnrPvO8Y", "title": "Shin'en: The Touryst (Nintendo Switch) Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ir2MnrPvO8Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}